      "note": "MoveKanturu1stBlurEffect MODEL_GENOCIDER (GM_Kanturu_1st.cpp:1747-1795): keys 5.5 to 6.9 of both attacks, eighteen short CreateBlur type 0 a frame in (1.0, 0.2, 0.0) on each of bones 49-52 (Bone23, Bone24, Bone25, Bone26: its weapon's four prongs), from 40 units back down the bone's own x to 10 out. Ours along each line from the hub, Bone12 (GENO_WP), to the prong, 0.44 to 0.94 m at scale 1: the prongs stand 0.84 m out, and MU's segments lie within 0.14 m of those lines on keys 0 and 6 of Attack 1 (FK of the rig). An offset in a bone's own axes does not survive the Blender rebuild."
