    "note": "Walking, play_breeds.cpp throws its weapon's dust off Bone12 each reference frame, as MU, and one of the meteor's stones (MODEL_STONE1/2) one frame in five at a third of MU's size where MU throws a full one every frame (GM_Kanturu_1st.cpp:1208-1216): forty rocks hopped round it (the user, 2026-10-23: \"something looks vierd, those fly things from monster\")."
